/**
 * A frozen league for component and unit tests.
 *
 * Tests must NOT assert against `data/team.json` or `data/players.json`: those
 * are rewritten by `scripts/sync-sleeper.ts` every six hours, so any test
 * coupled to their contents turns a roster move into a red build. That is a
 * check that moves, which makes progress incomparable between passes.
 *
 * The split of responsibility:
 *   - this fixture       -> behavior ("does the roster render, does the budget add up")
 *   - tests/schemas.test -> the committed files are valid and referentially sound
 *
 * The fixture keeps a slot of every kind, including TAXI and IR, so those paths
 * stay covered even when the real league has no such slots — as it turns out
 * this one does not.
 */

